ent": "Think of a place you would like to go for a special celebration."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the place and say why you want to go there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Invite your partner and make suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about places and customs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express preferences about places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make an invitation to go somewhere."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to suggestions about places."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le13ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa! How are things?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: All good. School keeps me busy! How's life in the Big Apple?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's amazing. There is so much to do around my hotel. <br />", "id": 1, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le13ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where is it?<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>:It's 2 blocks away from Central Park. You can see the skyline from the top.", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "engenn4le13ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The view from here  is exceptional, too.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I love skyscrapers. They look like canyons.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually\u2026 how about taking a trip to the Grand Canyon? <br />\n<span class =\"str